<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Your OTP Code</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: #333;">
  <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: auto; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid #eee; border-radius: 8px;">
    <h2 style="color: #444;">Verification Code</h2>
    <p>Hello,</p>
    <p>You requested a verification code. Use the code below to proceed:</p>
    <div style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #2c3e50; margin: 20px 0;">
      {{code}}
    </div>
    <p>This code will expire in 10 minutes. If you did not request it, please ignore this message.</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 24px;">Best regards,<br/>Your App Team</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
